<title>UK: St. Modwen forms JV with Kuwait's Salhia.</title>
<headline>St. Modwen forms JV with Kuwait's Salhia.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>St Modwen Properties Plc said on Monday that it has formed a joint venture with Salhia Real Estate Company of Kuwait to invest up to 100 million stg in UK commercial investment property.  </p>
<p>The 50/50 joint venture vehicle is called Key Property Investments Ltd and will generally be looking for lots in excess of 15 million stg, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
